Package: AusPak
Title: Explore Australia v Pakistan One Day International Cricket
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Somya", "Verma", , "sver0044@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides per-over scoring data for men's one-day
    internationals between Australia and Pakistan, a function that
    summarises runs and wickets by phase of an innings, and a Shiny app
    for comparing the two teams.
